    "chunk_text": "halgan f\u00e6mnan. SE23B2 Seo w\u00e6s in \u00f0\u00e6re ceastre Ioconio, ond heo w\u00e6s \u00f0\u00e6r beweddedo \u00e6\u00f0elum brydguman. SE23B3 \u00d0a gehyrde heo Paules lare \u00f0\u00e6s apostoles, \u00f0a gelyfde heo gode ond awunode in hyre SE23B5 Ond for\u00f0on heo arefnde monigu witu. SE23B6 Hy mon wearp in byrnende fyr, ond hio nolde byrnan, ond hy mon sende in wildra deora SE23B9 Hy mon wearp in s\u00e6deora sea\u00f0, ond \u00fea hyre ne sce\u00f0edon. SE23B10 Hy mon band on wilde fearras, ond \u00f0a hyre ne geegledon. SE23B12 Ond \u00f0a \u00e6t neahstan heo scear hyre feax swa swa weras ond gegyrede hy mid weres SE23B14 Tecle w\u00e6s swa myhtigu f\u00e6mne \u00fe\u00e6t heo ge\u00f0ingode to gode sumre h\u00e6\u00f0enre f\u00e6mnan g\u00e6ste SE24A1 On \u00f0one XXIIII d\u00e6g \u00fe\u00e6s mon\u00f0es bi\u00f0 sancti Iohannis geeacnung \u00fe\u00e6s miclan fulwihteres. SE24A2 \u00d0y d\u00e6ge Gabriel se heahengel \u00e6teowde Zacharie, Iohannis f\u00e6der, \u00fe\u00e6r he stod \u00e6t \u00f0am SE24A7 \u00dea nolde Zacharias \u00f0am engle gelyfan ond his wife on heora yldo meahte beon sunu SE24A9 \u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 se engel to him, \u00f0u bist dumb o\u00f0 \u00feone d\u00e6g o\u00f0 \u00f0\u00e6t \u00f0e \u00feis bi\u00f0. SE24A11 Ond hit \u00f0a w\u00e6s swa geworden. SE24B1 On \u00f0one ilcan d\u00e6g bi\u00f0 \u00feara haligra wera tid sancti Andochi \u00fe",
